* <Natural Source Header
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Version   3.5
* Function  Encode string with special char into named char
*           for OPO and NPR Unix. Version with Unicode variables
*
* Copycode for XXCPAG* modules, implements logging routine LOG-ENC-ERROR
*
* fhi§SAG Sep 2018
*
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
